Package: brochure
Title: Multipage 'Shiny' Apps
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Fay", , "contact@colinfay.me", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7343-1846"))
Description: Build natively multi-page 'Shiny' applications, serving
    content on several endpoints instead of a single page. Pages are
    declared with their own user interface and server function and are
    dispatched by URL, including parameterised routes. Redirections,
    request and response middleware, and helpers to read and set cookies
    are also provided.
